```python
def all_down_sets(less, n):
    """All down-sets of the poset (past-closed subsets)."""
    out = []
    for extra in range(0, 1 << n):
        u = frozenset(i for i in range(n) if extra & (1 << i))
        if all(x in u for y in u for x in range(n) if x == y or (x, y) in less):
            out.append(u)
    return out
```
